Method 1 — Easiest: Download from Cloud Shell ☁️ → 💻
Step 1: In Cloud Shell, go to the parent folder

You are currently inside:

~/business_consultant_agent

Run:

cd ~
Step 2: Compress the project into one ZIP file
zip -r business_consultant_agent.zip business_consultant_agent

This creates:

business_consultant_agent.zip
Step 3: Download the ZIP

In the Google Cloud Shell terminal, click the ⋮ (More) menu and choose:

Download

in Cloud Shell run:

cloudshell download ~/business_consultant_agent.zip

